
# Microsoft Sentinel SOC Lab
## Complete SIEM Integration From Scratch

---

# 1. Lab Objective

By the end of this lab, you will build a working Microsoft Sentinel SOC environment.

You will learn how to:

```text
Create Azure environment
        ↓
Create Log Analytics Workspace
        ↓
Enable Microsoft Sentinel
        ↓
Connect Sentinel to Defender portal
        ↓
Connect Azure Activity
        ↓
Write KQL queries
        ↓
Connect Entra ID
        ↓
Connect Defender XDR
        ↓
Deploy Linux log forwarder
        ↓
Install Azure Monitor Agent
        ↓
Create Data Collection Rules
        ↓
Collect Syslog
        ↓
Collect CEF
        ↓
Integrate FortiGate
        ↓
Create detection
        ↓
Create Analytics Rule
        ↓
Generate Alert
        ↓
Create Incident
        ↓
Investigate Incident
        ↓
Threat Hunting
        ↓
Automation
```

The goal is not simply to click around Azure until something turns green.

The goal is to understand the **complete SOC data flow**.

