# 2. Architecture You Will Build

The final architecture looks like this:

```text
                         AZURE
                           |
                           |
                 +---------v---------+
                 |   Resource Group  |
                 |    rg-soc-lab     |
                 +---------+---------+
                           |
                 +---------v---------+
                 | Log Analytics     |
                 | Workspace         |
                 | law-soc-lab       |
                 +---------+---------+
                           |
                 +---------v---------+
                 | Microsoft         |
                 | Sentinel          |
                 +---------+---------+
                           |
          +----------------+----------------+
          |                |                |
          v                v                v
     Azure Activity     Entra ID       Defender XDR
          |                |                |
          +----------------+----------------+
                           |
                           v
                         KQL
                           |
                           v
                  Analytics Rules
                           |
                           v
                         Alert
                           |
                           v
                       Incident
                           |
                           v
                     Investigation
                           |
                           v
                      Response


FortiGate
    |
    | Syslog / CEF
    |
    v
Linux Forwarder
    |
