Microsoft's current architecture for Syslog/CEF uses Azure Monitor Agent and Data Collection Rules, with the Linux machine acting either as the log source or as a dedicated forwarder. [Microsoft Learn](https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/sentinel/cef-syslog-ama-overview?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

